{{#handoff_context.target}}
Keep the shared handoff context updated at milestones in {{>handoff-context-target}}.

Update only `projects.{{project.name}}.worktrees.{{worktree.name}}`. The entry MUST include `timestamp` and `path`; `issue` and `phase` are optional. Include the information another agent or session needs to resume the work.

Before updating, acquire `{{handoff-context-path}}.lock`. Replace only an inactive lock, identify the lock as `{{project.name}}/{{worktree.name}}`, then reread the context and merge only this project/worktree entry. Preserve every other entry, atomically replace the context, and remove only the lock you acquired.
{{/handoff_context.target}}
{{^handoff_context.target}}
Handoff context is explicitly disabled for the current project.
{{/handoff_context.target}}
